<title>GERMANY: RWE Energie 96/97 prel. sales down 1 pct.</title>
<headline>RWE Energie 96/97 prel. sales down 1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Sales					  16,249  down 1 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German utility company is RWE Energie AG, a unit of the RWE group. The company also said preliminary results indicated it would post a higher profit for the 1996/1997 business year.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
